      ],
      "content": "SP 80 NW               ELLESBOROUGH                CHALKSHIRE ROAD 2/3                                                The Plough - -                                                  II House.  Mid C18, altered.  Chequer brick with first floor band course, tiled roof, flanking brick chimneys.  L-plan.  2 storeys and attic, 2 bays. Ground floor has canted bay windows with barred wooden casements and cornice continued across centre to form porch.  Blocked central doorway, now with small round window.  First floor has 3-light barred wooden casements and narrow blocked window to centre.  Small C20 attic window in right gable.  Door in right side of early C19 wing to rear. C20 lean-to conservatory to left. Listing NGR: SP8401208148"
    }
